# Visibility toggle semantics

IMPORTANT:

The project originally used toggle labels such as:

```text
Hide Flags
Hide Field 1 & 2
Hide Field 3, 4, 5 & 6
```

This concept was changed.

The switches must represent the VISIBLE STATE.

The correct labels are:

```text
Show Flags
Show Field 1 & 2
Show Field 3, 4, 5 & 6
```

The conceptual rule is:

```text
OFF = hidden
ON  = visible
```

Visually:

```text
OFF
○────
left
gray
hidden

ON
────●
right
colored
visible
```

The toggle must therefore behave like a normal modern switch.

