# Important Edge vs Anki distinction

Microsoft Edge itself can expose higher-quality Online/Natural voices through the browser `speechSynthesis` implementation.

This is different from Anki Desktop.

Conceptually:

```text
AnkiWeb
   ↓
Microsoft Edge
   ↓
SpeechSynthesis
   ↓
Microsoft Online / Natural voices
```

This may provide much better speech quality without generating audio files.

Anki Desktop instead uses its own Qt/WebEngine environment:

```text
Anki Desktop
   ↓
Qt / WebEngine reviewer
```

It is NOT the Microsoft Edge browser.

Therefore Edge Online/Natural voices may not be directly available through plain JavaScript inside Anki Desktop.

