# Previous multiple-of-five navigation

There is also an optional navigation button:

```text
<5
```

Behavior:

```text
36 → 35
35 → 30
34 → 30
30 → 25
6  → 5
5  → blank/reset
```

Implementation:

```javascript
window.showPreviousMultipleOfFive = function () {

  if (currentIndex < 0) {
    return;
  }

  const currentPosition =
    currentIndex + 1;

  const targetPosition =
    Math.floor(
      (currentPosition - 1) / 5
    ) * 5;

  if (targetPosition < 1) {

    currentIndex = -1;

  } else {

    currentIndex =
      targetPosition - 1;

  }

  render(true);

};
```

